              <p>This work is offered as supportive wellness counselling under registration with the ASCHP. It is distinct from clinical psychology, psychiatry, psychotherapy, and emergency mental health services, and is not a substitute for medical or psychiatric care.</p>
              <p>Where specialist assessment, treatment, or support appears appropriate, I will say so directly and, where possible, help point you towards the relevant professional resources. Part of my responsibility is recognising the limits of this work as well as its possibilities.</p>
